    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 11]\ntheorem erdos_288 : answer(sorry) ↔ Set.Finite { I : Fin 2 → ℕ+ × ℕ+ |\n    ∀ j, (I j).1 ≤ (I j).2 ∧\n      ∃ n : ℕ+, (∑ j : Fin 2, ∑ nⱼ ∈ Set.Icc (I j).1 (I j).2, (nⱼ⁻¹ : ℚ)) = n }",
